:"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","review_id":"4xO2qsKKie0dozkqHq8B4Q","date":"2021-10-19T18:59:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9518516659736633,"text_excerpt":"This place had a very cool vibe. Everything was on theme to get business done. That being said, I want to come back for the food and drink. I had the fried chicken bites and sweet chili sauce, power hour parmesan fries, The CEO frose and Business 75 cocktail. Everything was sooo good, I can't pick out just one thing to highlight. Please try anything I mentioned. The service was 10/10 and appreciated the option for outdoor seating."},{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","review_id":"7vXC481qBgiWtHGDqzW_yw","date":"2021-10-22T03:37:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9347303509712219,"text_excerpt":"Tried out The Business Bar and loved their Espresso Martini & Parmesan Fries! This is a great place for cocktails (very large drinks which is great) and delicious bites. I tried the Brussel Sprouts, which were pretty good but they weren't cooked all the way through. I do think they would be crispier if they were sliced instead of whole, but they were still delicious. Also, I didn't realized the BBQ Shrimp were going to be Unpeeled Shrimps, so just keep that in mind since it can be a bit messy to eat them. Overall, I loved the atmosphere and this bar/restaurant!"},{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","review_id":"uZxklRdaMpoj6Ql4aIKmHA","date":"2021-02-28T07:30:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.933944821357727,"text_excerpt":"Let's take about this spot called the @thebusinessbarnola located on Freret St. It is a dope chill vibe. We got here around 3:30pm but didn't know they close at 4pm on Saturday & Sunday, but this place is definitely a vibe. R&B playing as soon as you walk in and super cute greenery of plants that lined the restaurant. I got a classic margarita that was quite tasty. Im definitely coming back here to try their infamous CEO watermelon frozen rose and their LAMB CHOPS, for sure. The only thing I would say is we waited a bit for our waiter but not too long to be an inconvenience"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","photo_id":"Zu9JOmieuE4QKyIh0cMrew","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Zu9JOmieuE4QKyIh0cMrew.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9127496480941772},{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","photo_id":"ZFyuNKFxtKJRkeKhHV-mLg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZFyuNKFxtKJRkeKhHV-mLg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8954592943191528},{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","photo_id":"odQgFGXGv3OK8wrNQD4Xvg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/odQgFGXGv3OK8wrNQD4Xvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8466364145278931},{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","photo_id":"VuhHc-NPZvxeCTUyBBKLhA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VuhHc-NPZvxeCTUyBBKLhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8398057818412781},{"business_id":"_d4oswY38HTB5UWMMEt_jA","photo_id":"FA64BZ